WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.980
Outdoor Education Guidebook 
~Nagimi Middle School~

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:06.490
<i>Looking back, I can only describe 
it as a youthful indiscretion.</i>

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.990
<i>But from my second to third 
year of middle school,</i>

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.250
<i>I had what you might call a girlfriend.</i>

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.860
The Complete Works of Natsume Soseki

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.500
<i>This was before that happened...</i>

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:25.160
U-Um... Thank you for this afternoon.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:27.040
This afternoon?

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:33.180
You know... For splitting your 
curry ingredients with me.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.510
Oh, don't mention it.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.510
The moon is beautiful, isn't it?

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.420
D-D-Did you... W-W-Was that...

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.450
I didn't mean it like that.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.120
<i>Back then, we weren't even acquaintances,</i>

00:00:56.810 --> 00:00:58.990
<i>let alone close enough 
to make lasting memories.</i>

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:02.010
<i>Just strangers who happened to cross paths.</i>

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:06.570
<i>But even so, I've never forgotten that night.</i>

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.350
<b>My Stepmom's 
Daughter Is 
My Ex</b>

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:43.010
<b>Irido</b>

