Huh? Go where?

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.880
To buy a present.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.050
What for?

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.610
For Mother's Day!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:57.110
Mother's Day?

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:01.450
You forgot? I reminded you a week ago!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:07.660
I don't see why we need to go 
buy a present together, though.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:11.290
It'll make her think we're still getting along.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.390
I thought you'd feel less awkward 
if we gave her one together.

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:17.520
And we can split the cost this way, right?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.420
That last one is the real reason, no?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:23.430
It's the thought that counts, after all.
 Not the price tag.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.610
No thanks. Going shopping with 
you isn't exactly my idea of fun.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:31.190
At least let me spend my Sundays in peace.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.960
Okay.

