The Detective Is Already Dead

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:01.170
Goodness, how strange.

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:05.680
I'd have thought gawking at your sister 
 because she dolled up a bit

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:11.000
constituted breaking the rules,
 dear little brother.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.840
It's so crowded.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:21.940
It's always like this on weekends.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.700
I guess you wouldn't know 
since you stay cooped up.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.200
I stay cooped up <i>because </i>
I know it's like this.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.140
M-My bad. Gimme a sec. I'll get off you.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.330
Uh, no... Stop.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:42.010
W-We're just gonna end up this way 
every time it wobbles anyway.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.590
May as well get comfortable.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.220
A-All right.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.770
So, what kind of gift should we get Mom?

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:00.730
Let's see...

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.740
<b>As Seen On TV!</b>

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.740
<b>Diamond Coated</b>

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.740
<b>Lasts 10 million uses!</b>

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.740
How about a frying pan?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.870
She's a decent cook. Unlike someone.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.070
Huh?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.240
You do realize we already 
have four at home, don't you?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:12.780
Then something matching with Dad?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:16.960
Couple's Mug Set

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:16.540
Like she'd want that. 
She's not in middle school.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.960
We Print <b>Your</b> Photos

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.470
Then...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:24.470
Capture Your Memories on a Plate

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:24.470
We Print <b>Your</b> Photos

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:21.210
Personalized dishware?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.610
That's the absolute worst 
thing we could get her.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.470
<b>Irido</b>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.470
Thanks for always being there, Mom.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:36.480
This is your Mother's Day gift
 from me and Mizuto-kun.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:41.300
You always make our lunches in 
the morning and so much more.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:46.900
So we wanted to show our gratitude, 
I guess you could say.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.630
Thank you so much...

00:05:56.650 --> 00:06:00.780
You two are such good kids!

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.130
Mine-kun!

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:06.140
I never thought I'd ever get carnations! Ever!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.360
I think we made her happy.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.310
Yeah...

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.100
Did you come to watch?

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.440
I'm sorry.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.650
The door was open, so I was just curious...

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.420
You said you didn't remember much 
about your mother, right?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:16.040
Well, she died when I was very little.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:18.650
I only know her face from this picture.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.330
I see.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.270
What are you doing?

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.910
Supporting you.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.720
I am your older sister today, after all.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:41.730
I guess I signed up for this,
 so I can't complain.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.610
"If you're going to eat poison, 
might as well lick the plate."

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.570
Did you just call me poison?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.990
By the way, giving that 
present today got me thinking.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.010
This would be for both of our parents, but...

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.740
I was wondering if we could give them 
some alone time somehow.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.000
Alone time?

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:08.890
They're newlyweds,

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:12.340
but they barely get to spend 
any time as a couple, don't you think?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.050
I bet they're just trying 
to be considerate of us.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.560
I'm impressed.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.770
I didn't think you were capable 
of such noble consideration.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.740
Just how little do you think of me?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.440
Well, we could pay for them 
to eat out or go travel somewhere.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:34.410
But that's way out of budget 
with our allowance.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.410
Then let's think of it a different way.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:41.660
How about we go stay 
overnight somewhere instead?

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:43.240
Huh?

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:47.170
Hold it! Why would we do that?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:50.730
Why? We want to give
 our parents time alone, right?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.390
They deserve more than
 just a few hours, don't you think?

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.650
You're right.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.770
B-But a boy and a girl... 
staying somewhere overnight...

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.640
Don't tell me you think 
we'll be staying together.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.090
Huh? We're not?

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.440
Please...

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.470
Internet cafes only allow couples 
18 and up to stay the night.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:17.320
And we'd need parental permission 
to stay at a hotel or an inn.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.280
R-Right...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:25.540
Well, there is <i>one</i> place that'd let 
two high schoolers stay the night.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.230
There is? Where?

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.060
A love hotel.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.720
A... A l-l-love... love...

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.410
Apparently we can stay as long
as they don't figure out our ages.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.180
You in?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:43.930
O-O-Of course I'm not!

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.100
I figured.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:49.150
The rates were a little pricey 
when I checked earlier anyway.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:53.070
So you planned on us spending the 
night together if they weren't?!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.350
As a last resort.

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.860
A last resort?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:02.310
Now I'm <i>definitely</i> not in!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.370
<b>Irido</b>

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.500
About our conversation yesterday...

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:14.310
I was able to secure a place for us to stay.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.660
I'd like to give my parents some alone time.
 Could you help us out?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.660
Read

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.660
Kawanami

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:19.660
Sure thing. You can stay at my place
 if you want.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
Kawanami

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
Kawanami

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
Kawanami

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
And Irido-san can stay at Minami's!

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
She lives right next door, so you'll 
have less to worry about, right?

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:24.260
See you next Saturday, then!

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.270
Next door?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.020
I'd like to give my parents some alone time.
 Could you help us out?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.020
Read

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.020
Kawanami

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.020
Sure thing. You can stay at my place
 if you want.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.670
Yeah, I was surprised too.

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:32.060
I had no idea those two 
were next-door neighbors.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.030
<b>My Stepmom's Daughter Is My Ex</b>

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:45.540
It was your idea for both of you
to stay over, right, Irido-kun?

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.540
I gotta thank you.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:50.640
Spending the night with Yume-chan, 
just the two of us...

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:52.040
It's like a dream come true!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.040
Remember to behave yourself, Minami-san.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.710
Don't you worry!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.760
All right, let the man go already.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:03.550
Don't you see you're treading in
boys-only territory here?

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:06.440
"Boys-only"? Get over yourself.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.710
Aren't you forgetting something?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:08.520
Like what?

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:13.440
Your little princess over there
 is getting lonely.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.600
I'm sorry!

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:24.640
I promise never to leave your 
side ever again, Yume-chan!

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:26.680
That's all right, Akatsuki-san.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:29.450
Let's leave my little brother 
over there and hurry inside.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:37.500
All right, Kawanami.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.470
This is a girls-only zone, so don't 
even think about bothering us.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:44.570
You don't have to tell me. 
There's no way I'd set foot in your place.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:47.430
Say, Akatsuki-san...

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.310
What exactly is your relationship 
with Kawanami-kun?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:53.940
Oh, nothing you need to worry about, really.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.900
We're next-door neighbors...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:00.400
...who just happen to have hung out with 
each other since elementary school.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.520
So you're childhood friends.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:08.320
That title is reserved for people
 who <i>remain</i> close, in the present tense.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:10.660
You two seem pretty close to me.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:16.670
The word "astronomical" doesn't 
even begin to describe

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.420
the distance between me and her.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.050
And yet...

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.050
<b>Kawanami</b>

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.740
as for the physical distance between you...

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.050
<b>Minami</b>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.980
you're next-door neighbors.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.270
That must be hell on earth.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.530
Damn straight.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.140
Looks like you've got a lot going on.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.900
Well, I'll be the last person 
to pry into someone else's business.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.570
That's great, 'cause I'll be the first.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.990
So, how far have you gone with Irido-san?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.950
Have some decency, would you?

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:46.940
I'll be blunt.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.740
Have you ever seen her boobs?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.880
Give me a break!

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:53.460
Even if I <i>had</i>, you think I'd tell <i>you</i> that?

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.380
Interesting...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.540
Very interesting!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.630
So Yume's boobs are for your eyes only.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.720
Is what you're saying, right, Irido?!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.330
Stop, Yume-chan! Stop!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:16.100
Between your hands and that wall, 
it's only a matter of time before one gives out!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:20.110
August 15th (Sat)

