 were paper thin?!

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.110
Let me be clear, Kawanami.

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.930
There's no way I'm taking this lying down.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:29.830
Hey!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.470
Hey!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.870
When I Grow Up
by Kawanami Kogure

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.870
"When I Grow Up," huh? What a lovely title.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.830
N-Not that!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.290
Anything but that, Irido!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.660
"When I Grow Up," by Kawanami Kogure.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:46.510
"When I grow up, 
I want to be a police officer."

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.460
"I'll become a strong policeman. That way..."

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.240
D-Don't say it!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:55.890
"I can marry Akatsuki-chan 
and always keep her safe."

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.480
Wait! Stop, Akatsuki-san! Stop!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.240
Something cracked! 
I swear I heard something crack!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.690
Kawanami!

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.060
Try to calm down!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.460
I told you to throw that out, didn't I?!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.790
Knock it off already!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.660
Now Yume-chan of all people heard it!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.960
You think I wanted this?!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:16.480
It's your fault for making stupid 
jokes in the first place, dummy!

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:18.370
Shut it, dingus!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:23.820
Did no one ever tell you to treat others 
the way you want to be treated?

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:27.610
And you're telling me you two aren't close?

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.460
<i>Dang it.</i>

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:40.080
<i>I forgot Kawanami likes to come here too!</i>

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.770
<i>There goes my one-on-one 
dinner date with Yume-chan.</i>

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:47.150
You call eating at a dirt-cheap 
family restaurant a dinner date?

